╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: [Bug]: ToolResponse can downgrade an error state when appending later chunks                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ## Prerequisites                                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ -  I searched existing issues, discussions, and open/closed pull requests; I did not find a duplicate.                                          │
│ -  This is a bug rather than a usage question.                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Background / Description                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ `ToolResponse.append_chunk()` documents that it preserves the failure state and keeps the previous state when a later chunk is not worse.       │
│ However, after an `ERROR` chunk, a later `INTERRUPTED` or `DENIED` chunk overwrites the aggregate response state.                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ A streamed tool response can therefore finish with a non-error state even though one of its chunks failed. The aggregate should keep            │
│ `ToolResultState.ERROR` once observed.                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Error Messages                                                                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ No exception is raised. The incorrect aggregate state is:                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```text                                                                                                                                         │
│ ToolResultState.INTERRUPTED                                                                                                                     │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ (or `ToolResultState.DENIED`) instead of `ToolResultState.ERROR`.                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Steps to Reproduce                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```python                                                                                                                                       │
│ from agentscope.message import TextBlock, ToolResultState                                                                                       │
│ from agentscope.tool import ToolChunk, ToolResponse                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ response = ToolResponse()                                                                                                                       │
│ response.append_chunk(                                                                                                                          │
│     ToolChunk(                                                                                                                                  │
│         content=[TextBlock(text=failed)],                                                                                                       │
│         state=ToolResultState.ERROR,                                                                                                            │
│     ),                                                                                                                                          │
│ )                                                                                                                                               │
│ response.append_chunk(                                                                                                                          │
│     ToolChunk(                                                                                                                                  │
│         content=[TextBlock(text=interrupted)],                                                                                                  │
│         state=ToolResultState.INTERRUPTED,                                                                                                      │
│     ),                                                                                                                                          │
│ )                                                                                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ assert response.state == ToolResultState.ERROR                                                                                                  │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The assertion currently fails because `response.state` is `ToolResultState.INTERRUPTED`.                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Environment                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ - AgentScope Version: 2.0.5 (current `main`, commit `999f64d`)                                                                                  │
│ - Python Version: 3.12.13                                                                                                                       │
│ - OS: Windows 11                                                                                                                                │
